cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "GA-Optimized Decision Trees"
abstract: >-
  A genetic algorithm framework for evolving interpretable decision trees. It trades
  accuracy against tree complexity with weighted-sum fitness or NSGA-II multi-objective
  search, and ships a nested cross-validation and hypervolume benchmark harness against
  CART, random search and other baselines.
